      "value": "Please note avtr_ba3daad5-0c64-4fb4-8593-38265acd9ad3 has been replaced by avtr_5c972960-700e-41e8-9cb3-136a2c081853 , please use this new ID for testing against. \n\nI got sick of waiting for a fix on this and since it affects live products I can't just leave this forever. I manged to find a workaround for the jitter in this case by world constraining the physbone so it never actually moves, which of course only works because the physbone is invisible and im only measuring the angle. The new ID is an upload of the old version before the fix.",
